# ArrowDown from a dialog's tabs reaches the box under them, though it is position sticky: its parent is no taller, so it can never move and is plain content. A bar that does stick still waits for the end of its box.
pages/sticky-no-room.html
start:css=#history-tab
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#composer
start:css=#history-tab
eval:placeAboveFoot('history-tab', 227)
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#composer
start:css=#thread-2
eval:placeAboveFoot('thread-2', 100)
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#thread-3
